  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n{(59×59×59)+(54×54×54)+(57×57×57)-3(59)(54)(57)} over{(59+54+57)}\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = (a + b +c)(a² + b² + c² - ab - bc - ac)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n{(59×59×59)+(54×54×54)+(57×57×57)-3(59)(54)(57)} over{(59+54+57)}\n\n⇒ {(59)³+(54)³+(57³)-3(59)(54)(57)} over{(59+54+57)}\n\nUsing a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = (a + b +c)(a² + b² + c² - ab - bc - ac)\n\n⇒ 54² + 59² + 57² - ( 3186 + 3363 + 3078)\n\n⇒ 2916 + 3481 + 3249 - 9627\n\n⇒ 9646 - 9627 = 19\n\n∴ The simplified value is 19.\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] __Shortcut Trick__**\n\na³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = 1/2(a + b + c)[(a - b)² + (b - c)² + (c - a)²]\n\na = 59, b = 57 and c = 54\n\nso\n\n= (1/2)(2² + 3² + 5²)\n\n= (1/2)(4 + 9 + 25)\n\n= 19",
